Models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Descript Audio Codec (DAC), 44.1 kHz — MIT License, © Descript, Inc.
  Downloaded on first run via `dac.utils.download()`; installed as the
  `descript-audio-codec` PyPI package.
  Source: https://github.com/descriptinc/descript-audio-codec
  Used frozen: its decoder renders the predicted RVQ codes back into a waveform.
  Its weights are not modified.

