Checkpoints
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Diamond weights (`nineninesix/diamond-1.0`) were trained with the pipeline in
the diamond-train repository (https://github.com/nineninesix-ai/diamond-train),
on the public speech corpora listed in its configuration. Those corpora carry
their own licenses — see the NOTICE file of diamond-train.
